WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:03.405
新建请求 / Create a request

2
00:00:03.405 --> 00:00:06.307
添加 x-guide-toggle=enabled / Add the test Header

3
00:00:06.307 --> 00:00:09.256
添加 guide=enabled / Add the test Query

4
00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:12.259
重发并核对两个字段 / Send and verify both enabled fields

5
00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:15.063
停用 Query 行 / Disable the Query row

6
00:00:15.063 --> 00:00:17.957
停用 Header 行 / Disable the Header row

7
00:00:17.957 --> 00:00:20.857
重发并确认字段未发送 / Send without the disabled fields

8
00:00:20.857 --> 00:00:23.706
删除 Header 行 / Delete the Header row

9
00:00:23.706 --> 00:00:26.607
删除 Query 行 / Delete the Query row

10
00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:29.960
选择 POST 与 JSON / Select POST and JSON

11
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.806
Format JSON / Format JSON

12
00:00:32.806 --> 00:00:35.707
发送并核对格式化后的 JSON / Send and verify formatted JSON

13
00:00:35.707 --> 00:00:38.607
选择 Body None / Select Body None

14
00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:41.504
发送空正文 / Send without a body

15
00:00:41.504 --> 00:00:44.457
从 Recent sends 选择旧地址 / Select an earlier Recent send

16
00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:47.357
核对没有恢复已删除字段或正文 / Check that fields and body were not restored
